WEBVTT

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.880
Deep in the woods, there was a training facility.

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:16.080
Amazing...

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:21.880
To us, it was known simply as "the Farm."

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.330
It served one purpose:

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.290
To train first-class spies.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.000
This is why, if they determined
that a girl did not meet their standards,

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.250
we'd wake up one day and find she was gone.

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.960
Saying goodbye was never part of the program.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:57.170
Finished.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.170
What? You're kidding!

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:00.130
Already?

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:01.040
Finished!

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:02.670
Whoa! Her, too?!

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:03.790
How?!

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:09.380
Come on, girls.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.210
You don't have to be THAT fast.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:16.420
I understand you were classmates?

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:17.210
Yes, Sir.

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:20.380
She was an extremely good student.

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:24.210
An honor student whose grades
never fell below second place.

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:26.420
We still have her records.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:30.330
You two will be well-suited for this mission.

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:32.580
You think so, sir?

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:34.580
What have you said to her?

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:37.330
We've told her what she needs to know.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.830
Now I want you to meet her on-site
and determine how to proceed.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:43.420
Yes, Sir.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:19.040
Our mission is to retrieve top secret documents

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.000
from the estate of the First Lord of the Admiralty.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.580
The operation will take place on the 25th.

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.130
Christmas.

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:27.630
That's today!

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.830
We can't! We haven't done anything to prepare!

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:33.920
That's alright. We have an ally on the inside.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:36.920
She'll be our guide when we get there.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.580
She's good at what she does. Don't worry.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:41.960
You know her?

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:43.630
We were classmates.

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:45.710
Back at the training facility.

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:57.210
The sea charts of all Europe are about to change.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:02.750
With the marked increase in military power,
if we are to resist the navies of the World Powers,

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:08.540
we must disband the Channel Fleet defending
Albion proper, and move forward with our plans

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:16.750
to join it with the Atlantic Fleet, combining all of
the Kingdom's forces into the new Grand Fleet.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.790
Well, it's Christmas. That should do for tonight.

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:23.670
Yes, Your Lordship.

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:31.210
Will you be spending the evening
with anyone, Miss Eleanor?

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:32.830
No one.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.040
I don't much care for Christmas.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.540
And why might that be?

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.580
It reminds me of an old acquaintance.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:43.250
Oh?

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.290
She was...

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:49.130
the woman I always wished I could be.

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:54.330
They said it was the third window from the right?

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.630
Yes. That window, there.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:00.250
And your classmate left it unlocked for us?

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:01.170
Yeah.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:02.670
Let's go.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:24.670
You think so, too, right?

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:26.000
You do have a point.

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:37.750
Your posture is all wrong.

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:41.420
The way you shift your weight
makes your footsteps louder.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:43.540
Strict as ever, I see.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.880
Give her some slack.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:48.580
She wasn't trained at the Farm like we were.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:51.420
You can't expect the enemy to give you slack.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.170
Are YOU...

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:58.580
Miss Ange's classmate?

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.710
I can't believe they sent the two of you.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.000
Control has its moments.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.330
And now we can have a class reunion.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.380
We're not going to do that.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:10.710
Agreed.

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:12.920
Could you at least TRY to get along?

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:17.170
We ARE the only three left from our class, after all.

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:18.830
Really? You are?

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:22.460
Do you have any idea what you're actually doing?

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:24.460
I struggle to understand.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:27.710
Why in the world did Control send us this amateur?

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.960
Those two are simply amazing.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:02.960
They've hardly said a word to each other,
but they work perfectly together.

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:06.670
They were by far the best in our class.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:13.580
Over there.

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:19.540
The secret documents are in a cellar
under the gamekeeper's cabin.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.500
But there's a problem.

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:25.000
Those annoying guards.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.290
Dogs? And so many of them!

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:30.750
We can't win them over with bribes or flattery.

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:32.170
What's your plan?

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:34.920
This is why we're here.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:35.880
Beatrice.

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.130
Yes, I can take care of this.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:56.580
Not even the Farm's top of the class could
pull off a trick like that, right?

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:01.750
You two keep a lookout.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.210
Wh-what...

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:22.580
As expected, she's good.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.420
So are you, Prefect.

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:27.500
I've heard about your exploits since we graduated.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.750
I was desperate, that's all.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.420
Do you think Ange and the others are alright?

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:39.080
Worry not.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:42.000
You are aware of their degree of skill.

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:43.790
True, but...

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.210
Miss Chise, what is that?

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.960
It is a shishi odoshi.

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:55.750
A proper one should be made of bamboo,
but unfortunately, I could not obtain any.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:58.960
What do you use it for?

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:00.670
What do I...?

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:01.920
Hmm.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:11.500
Cheers!

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:18.830
You just did a toast a little while ago.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.330
That was number 17.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.080
You were counting?

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:25.790
Our Prefect's always been obsessed with details.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:29.080
You make it sound like a bad thing.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.960
It was a compliment!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:33.130
Because I'm just the opposite.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:37.080
Um, they have prefects at spy school?

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:39.170
"Prefect" is a nickname.

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:44.130
Because she's responsible and gets good grades.
And took charge of our class.

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:46.080
I was just a nag, that's all.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:49.330
Besides, my grades were eternally second-best.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.710
That's not your fault.

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:52.420
Number one was a space alien.

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:54.500
That's "Black Lizard Planet native."

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:58.380
So has Miss Ange always been like this?

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:00.630
She was odd for as long as I've known her.

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:02.380
And you were normal.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.420
Are you calling me average?

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.380
It's not an insult.

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:08.540
Of course.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:12.380
You don't care about people enough to insult them.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:18.040
So they don't get along?

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:20.500
Well, they were rivals.

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:23.250
Please excuse me.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:25.210
Aww, you're leaving?

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:27.830
I'm going to the powder room. Don't make me say it.

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:30.040
Have fun!

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:41.580
You never change, do you?

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:54.080
Oh?

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.580
Where are the others?

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:58.000
I sent the children home.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.630
But the night's still young.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.250
Drink with me.

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:03.580
Alright.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:06.000
A double agent?

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:08.380
There's a possibility.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:15.040
Our real mission is to find out
whether or not she's betrayed us.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.830
Why didn't you tell me?

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:20.710
Because we wanted to avoid raising
her suspicions as much as possible.

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:23.210
You would have acted differently.

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:25.880
That may be true, but...

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.630
This is it.

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:30.670
Where are we?

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:32.670
Prefect's boarding house.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.540
Cheers!

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.500
That's 21.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.250
You're still counting?

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:43.750
Do you remember?

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:45.830
The Christmas exam.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:47.580
Exam?

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:49.540
Oh yeah, I remember.

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:53.750
You, Ange, and I were all on a team together.

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:56.250
You lost sight of the target?

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:57.960
I'm so sorry!

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.500
We'll never pass the exam now.

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:02.670
All because I failed!

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:05.630
We just have to find them again-

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:07.830
The exam ends tonight!

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:10.460
Finding one person in a city like this...

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.960
it's like looking for a leaf in the forest!

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:15.420
Well, I guess that's true.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:17.210
In that case...

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.330
let's go have fun!

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.170
What?

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.750
They don't let us out of the Farm every day.

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:26.000
And I think the traveling funfair is in town.

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:29.880
What are you thinking? We're in the middle of an exam!

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:32.330
But we've already failed, right?

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.290
I thought you were a blithering idiot.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.540
But you did go to the funfair with me.

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.290
I was desperate.

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:42.380
I was sure I was going to be expelled.

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:47.040
You really believed them when they said
they'd expel us if we failed the test.

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:52.630
But of course, while we were out fooling around,
Ange went and found our target.

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:55.170
She's a natural, that girl.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:13:00.380
That's the first time I've ever heard
you say anything nice about Ange.

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:01.500
Really?

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:03.420
That makes me happy.

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.290
But I'm not sure why.

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:13.380
Look at all that snow.

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:15.580
Say, Dorothy.

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:19.290
Have you ever had someone you really looked up to?

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.880
I... don't think so.

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:25.250
I have.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:27.960
Someone I wanted to be like so badly.

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.960
But I just couldn't pull it off.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.080
Let's pull out.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:43.080
I couldn't find any evidence.

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:44.460
Alright!

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:48.460
I'm glad your friend's not a double agent.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:49.630
Correction.

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:52.040
I...

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:54.130
am not her friend.

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:17.880
I knew it.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:19.960
They came to spy on me.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.380
She's making a move.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:32.420
Prefect...

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:37.710
What's going on?

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:39.960
You just said there wasn't any evidence.

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:44.250
I deliberately left footprints on the trap she had set up.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.670
I figured that if she was up to anything,
she would react and make a move.

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:50.960
We're going to apprehend her.

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:53.500
At this time of day, she'd be going to the station.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.920
I'll head her off.

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:57.330
You two go after her.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.130
We'll have her surrounded when she gets to the station.

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.710
You're not going to use the C-ball?

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:10.330
I want to save it for a last resort.

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:15.750
Why would you do this, Prefect?

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.630
We've caught up to her.

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:31.330
Now we just make sure she doesn't see-

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:32.710
Miss Ange?

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.210
I give up.

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.630
This whole thing was a setup, and I fell for it.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.290
I won't ask why you betrayed us.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:51.080
That's not part of the assignment.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:55.250
And I'm sure you wouldn't let me go
just because I asked nicely.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:56.420
Don't move!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.580
Put down the gun and your case,
and put your hands in the air.

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:06.290
You've changed.

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:09.710
The old you would have ended it
with one shot to the back of my head.

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:15.170
I don't suppose a certain someone
planted feelings in the black lizard's heart?

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:17.380
But...

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:30.920
Gunfire?

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:32.130
She didn't!

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:35.960
The new you is a sitting duck!

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:38.130
Miss Ange!

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:39.000
Stay back.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.420
You'll get burned.

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:44.580
Ange! Beatrice!

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:47.460
What happened? Did she spot you?

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:49.460
No, er...

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:53.210
We brought the fight to her... you might say...

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.420
Ange!

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:58.580
I told you we'd surround her! Why didn't you wait?

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:01.420
I wanted to ensure the mission's success.

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:04.830
Did you think you could beat
our prefect all by yourself?

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:09.210
Or were you trying to prove
which one of you was really the better spy?

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.420
Answer me, Ange!

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.500
Excuse me, Miss!

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:20.540
Hey!

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:30.330
We can't allow this, Young Lady.

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:34.250
I'm sorry. I don't suppose you have
any vacant compartments?

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:37.000
But of course.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:39.880
Follow me, Miss.

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:41.130
Thank you.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:46.710
I would like to get some sleep.
Would you please lend me a blanket?

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.330
Right away, Miss.

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:03.000
If we go in a straight line,
we'll catch up to her at the bridge.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.380
There she is!

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:20.460
What took you so long?

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.080
Dorothy!

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:25.920
How did you...?

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:29.290
I caught up by car and jumped aboard with the C-ball.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:32.880
The C-ball... I'd heard the rumors.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:36.000
So it was issued to your team.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.330
They have high hopes for you.

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:39.750
For Ange, yes.

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:50.580
You can't just ask me to take the wheel!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.500
You're really something.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:02.960
Giving Ange the slip like that.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:04.130
It was luck.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:07.500
I didn't think it would work that well.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.040
It was skill.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.540
You beat Ange, Prefect.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:15.170
You just don't get it.

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:19.130
The woman I looked up to was never Ange.

00:19:20.210 --> 00:19:22.380
The woman I always looked up to...

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:25.040
The woman I wanted so badly to be like...

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.790
...but never could.

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:30.960
It was you, Dorothy.

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:35.460
The truth is, I never cared about grades.

00:19:35.460 --> 00:19:37.960
I only did everything I could to be a good student,

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:40.750
because I didn't want to disappoint anyone.

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:44.500
But I got tired of it all.

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:48.210
So you took a break, but you weren't careful...
and they got you?

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:49.630
Or...

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:51.040
Both.

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:55.130
If only I could have been more like you.

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:56.830
Prefect...

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:02.500
You know, that Christmas, it was my first time at a funfair.

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.500
It was fun.

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.580
I still dream about it.

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:21.540
About how we fooled around, and laughed together.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:27.250
Then let's go again! Come to London!

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:29.420
I'll introduce you to my team, and...

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.250
Dorothy.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:35.170
You were always like the wind.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.380
So light and free.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.880
Stop it, Prefect.

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.500
I don't want to shoot a friend.

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:43.830
Thank you.

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:46.670
Because you were kind enough to call me your friend,

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.920
I'll give you a Christmas present.

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:53.380
A free pass, to get you out of shooting your friend.

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:56.130
Don't do it... Prefect!

00:20:57.460 --> 00:21:00.290
Goodbye, Dorothy.

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:30.830
Thanks, Ange.

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:32.670
For what?

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:34.210
When you jumped the gun back there...

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:38.210
you were trying to make sure
I didn't have to shoot Prefect, weren't you?

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:42.420
I was increasing the odds of our mission's success.

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:43.920
That's all.

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:48.500
For crying out loud, I'm surrounded by liars.

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:51.250
Well, we are spies.

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:54.040
Yeah. We are.

00:21:57.380 --> 00:21:58.250
Enter.

00:21:58.250 --> 00:21:59.380
Excuse us.

00:22:04.290 --> 00:22:06.380
L has been transferred.

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:08.000
I am the General.

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:11.420
From now on, you will be taking orders from me.

00:22:11.420 --> 00:22:13.580
Did something happen to L?

00:22:13.580 --> 00:22:15.540
That's none of your concern.

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:19.830
You both did well on this last mission.

00:22:20.580 --> 00:22:25.790
Since you were so successful, I would like you
to move right on to your next assignment.

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:27.830
Assignment... Sir?

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:29.580
Her.

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:31.540
That's...

00:22:32.420 --> 00:22:34.880
You will assassinate Princess.
